WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.777
To keep a copy of your records, open
Settings, then Data Management.

00:00:05.627 --> 00:00:06.814
Tap Save Backup.

00:00:08.014 --> 00:00:10.836
Choose where to keep the file in Files and
save it.

00:00:11.786 --> 00:00:14.017
Wait for Backup Saved before you leave.

00:00:15.317 --> 00:00:16.479
The copy is encrypted.

00:00:17.279 --> 00:00:23.724
It includes your records, note history and
attachments, but not device-only choices
such as the privacy lock.

00:00:24.974 --> 00:00:27.158
Keep your backup key somewhere safe as
well.

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:30.685
Without the key used for that file, you
can't open it.

00:00:31.785 --> 00:00:34.733
RosterEase doesn't keep a server copy of
your backup or key.

00:00:35.733 --> 00:00:38.202
Weekly backups are a separate option on
this screen.
